````
TileDebug
       {
            "title": "tiledebug",
            "visible": true,
            "sourceOptions": {
                "type": "tiledebug"
            }
        },
TileImage
        {
            "baselayer: "baselayer",
            "sourceOptions": {
                "url": "/service@EPSG_3857/{z}/{x}/{-y}.png",
                "type": "xyz"
            }
        }
````

**Expected behavior**
How handle a tiledebug layer with an inverted Y coordinate ( {-y} ) without having to define a custom tilegrid?
